    "why": "Average phase voltage, V"
   },
   {
    "ref": "AI 1",
    "name": "Frequency",
    "why": "Supply frequency, Hz"
   }
  ],
  "enable": null,
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "Factory default protocol is Modbus RTU; change Protocol Selection to 1 for BACnet MS/TP (default settings password 0000).",
   "MAC address 0-127, default 0; baud 9600, 19200, 38400 or 76800, default 38400; Max Info Frames 1-250, default 10.",
   "Device instance default 1, range 1-4,194,302.",
   "The last settings screen resets the meter; the reset is needed to save the BACnet settings."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "Several printed names repeat (AI 57/58, AI 77-82); map by instance, not by name.",
   "Units in the source table are shifted on some rows; check scaling against the meter display."
  ]
 },
